- [EDITAR] `backend/app/services/auth_service.py` (consulta, bcrypt y JWT).
- [EDITAR] `backend/app/core/security.py` (bcrypt/JWT).
- [EDITAR] `backend/tests/test_auth_endpoint.py` (contrato HTTP con PostgreSQL).

**Frontend:**
